{
  "summary": "Bounded test-only integration draft for rv_iommu_tl_wrap with PolicyEnable=1 and NonblockEnable=1. Adds tests/composition_tl_top.sv (testbench top exposing policy_partition_i, policy_clear_i, policy_did_i, policy_quiet_o and an IOTLB research fillmask snapshot), tests/composition_tl_test.cpp (S/N/P/PN mode gating, PN concurrent V fast-probe vs A fill allocation, policy_quiet_o temporal checks, idle policy_clear and re-warm), and tests/test_composition_tl.py (Verilator build/run harness). No production RTL is modified. The A-fill allocation proof is direct: every IOTLB fill records research_replace_mask_o and research_did_o; the test asserts DID10 fills are subsets of 0x0003 and DID11 fills are subsets of 0xfffc, including the fill that occurs after a concurrent V fast probe was accepted while A was held in PT.",
